title: A Disturbance in the Force
subtitle: Something is being prepared against us.
tags: event
view-if: scheme_pending != "" and scheme_foreseen and not scheme_warned and not finale and not game_ending
priority: 2
new-page: true
face-image: img/ev_shadow.svg
on-arrival: scheme_warned = 1

= A Disturbance in the Force

[+ scheme_foresee +]

*Because we have been watching closely, we have a turn to act. Whoever is behind this will strike next turn unless we stop it.*

- @counter: [+ scheme_counter +] (1 political capital).
- @counter_adv: [+ scheme_counter +], through one of our advisors.
- @ignore: We cannot chase every shadow.

@counter
subtitle: −1 political capital. The plot will be foiled.
choose-if: capital >= 1
unavailable-subtitle: Needs 1 political capital.
on-arrival: capital -= 1; scheme_countered = 1

The Caucus quietly moves to head it off.

@counter_adv
subtitle: Uses our advisors' shared action. The plot will be foiled.
choose-if: advisor_action_timer <= 0 and n_advisors >= 1
unavailable-subtitle: Our advisors have already acted recently.
on-arrival: advisor_action_timer = 5; scheme_countered = 1

One of our advisors takes it in hand.

@ignore

We let it go, and hope it was nothing.
